    "article_summary": "The article describes a visible-light-mediated three-component dicarbofunctionalization of styrenes using benzylic radicals generated from Katritzky pyridinium salts. This undirected strategy allows for the rapid synthesis of densely functionalized 1,1-diarylalkanes, including those derived from amino acids and peptides, under mild photoredox conditions using an iridium catalyst.",
